{"id":4559,"date":"2025-07-07T06:24:17","date_gmt":"2025-07-07T06:24:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=4559"},"modified":"2025-08-11T06:52:25","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T06:52:25","slug":"dich-vu-van-hanh-amazon-hieu-qua","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/dich-vu-van-hanh-amazon-hieu-qua\/","title":{"rendered":"D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 cho b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"Zl7VdGEHFonqVYxLw2qlrBsKgee\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DyFVd2woaoLeAZxsYU3lcvysgZb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-LOdKd6NQaoBV9HxkOLVl3RvFgfe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon l\u00e0 g\u00f3i gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n gi\u00fap nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 quy tr\u00ecnh kinh doanh tr\u00ean s\u00e0n Amazon \u2013 t\u1eeb kh\u00e2u \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n h\u00e0ng, l\u01b0u kho, x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n nhanh ch\u00f3ng \u0111\u1ebfn tay kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. C\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon Digital<\/strong><\/a> t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u ngay!<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YDGYdnkniog4i2x45XzlHZ2ngof\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-FbPrd73gMohXfixUoUclI5Gmgyg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon l\u00e0 g\u00ec?<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TfAOd9IR4orbTBxy16AlJa68gQf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon l\u00e0 c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n gian h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng Amazon, gi\u00fap t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a quy tr\u00ecnh b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng, t\u0103ng doanh thu v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 n\u00e0y th\u01b0\u1eddng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c cung c\u1ea5p b\u1edfi c\u00e1c c\u00f4ng ty chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p nh\u01b0 Livads Agency, bao g\u1ed3m c\u00e1c ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nh\u01b0 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh gian h\u00e0ng, marketing, ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng, v\u00e0 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd h\u1eadu c\u1ea7n, \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t cho th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed xuy\u00ean bi\u00ean gi\u1edbi<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RSkXdAL7Mod8Pjx7ymaltpgZgRe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<figure id=\"attachment_4567\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4567\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4567\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56.png\" alt=\"D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon, hay c\u00f2n g\u1ecdi l\u00e0 Fulfillment by Amazon (FBA), l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 m\u00e0 Amazon cung c\u1ea5p cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/56-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4567\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon, hay c\u00f2n g\u1ecdi l\u00e0 Fulfillment by Amazon (FBA), l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 m\u00e0 Amazon cung c\u1ea5p cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd.<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OvIVd81RxoLGDbx2bIElN1eHgze\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Quy tr\u00ecnh v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QAjPdYTnUouxWMxJnHVlw2YggYd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u1ef1a tr\u00ean b\u1ea3ng quy tr\u00ecnh v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon \u0111\u00e3 cung c\u1ea5p v\u00e0 th\u00f4ng tin chi ti\u1ebft tr\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u00f3, d\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 t\u1eebng b\u01b0\u1edbc v\u1edbi c\u00e1c s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u chi ph\u00ed \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i sang \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb VN\u0110 (t\u1ef7 gi\u00e1 tham kh\u1ea3o: 1 USD = 25.000 VN\u0110, theo t\u1ef7 gi\u00e1 trung b\u00ecnh th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng ng\u00e0y 17\/06\/2025). C\u00e1c s\u1ed1 li\u1ec7u \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u00e0m tr\u00f2n \u0111\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 theo d\u00f5i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QoX5d0miPoS6Fix1DKylDSQNgne\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">D\u01b0\u1edbi \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 quy tr\u00ecnh v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon FBA tr\u00ecnh b\u00e0y d\u1ea1ng g\u1ea1ch \u0111\u1ea7u d\u00f2ng, \u0111\u00e3 <strong>b\u1ecf to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 icon<\/strong> \u0111\u1ec3 d\u1ec5 s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng trong t\u00e0i li\u1ec7u ho\u1eb7c h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng:<\/div>\n<div class=\" old-record-id-O0VSdDTpFooVNdxoiC2lEb5Zgad\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-W9xud2Oy3okT4AxmhWml6fDogXg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SqnddLbZ6oiEu4x0L6OlLqcogSg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n t\u1ea1i sellercentral.amazon.com<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UpfSdV2ESoMdjaxhIlVlityogze\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n C\u00e1 nh\u00e2n: Mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SU7UdTjcwoZpv9x5rr3lYLWJgye\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Doanh nghi\u1ec7p: 39,99 USD\/th\u00e1ng \u2248 999.750 VN\u0110\/th\u00e1ng<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZLM9dsMquo1Y5Gx4JOdlaqTHgFf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Y\u00eau c\u1ea7u: CCCD\/h\u1ed9 chi\u1ebfu, th\u1ebb t\u00edn d\u1ee5ng qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf, sao k\u00ea ng\u00e2n h\u00e0ng, h\u00f3a \u0111\u01a1n ti\u1ec7n \u00edch<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TsnBdPGlWoompTxuSl7lWoTggHh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>62% ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ch\u1ecdn t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n Doanh nghi\u1ec7p \u0111\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n t\u00edch<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KG1kdy4hkoOk5sxvbcklrLIPggg\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Th\u1eddi gian x\u00e1c minh: 1\u20133 ng\u00e0y (t\u1ed1i \u0111a 7 ng\u00e0y n\u1ebfu thi\u1ebfu gi\u1ea5y t\u1edd)<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Yqeodm0KLoS7FqxWjr3lloMCgyd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>G\u1eedi h\u00e0ng v\u00e0o kho Amazon (FBA)<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi t\u1ea1o shipment v\u00e0 chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb h\u00e0ng cho Amazon FBA, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n c\u1ea7n in nh\u00e3n FNSKU, \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i \u0111\u00fang ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n (theo h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn c\u1ee7a Amazon v\u1ec1 k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc, v\u1eadt li\u1ec7u v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch s\u1eafp x\u1ebfp). H\u00e0ng sau \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ebfn kho Amazon b\u1eb1ng \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng bi\u1ec3n ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng. C\u1ee5 th\u1ec3, chi ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng bi\u1ec3n dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 0,5\u20131 USD\/kg (t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng 12.500\u201325.000 VN\u0110\/kg) v\u1edbi th\u1eddi gian giao h\u00e0ng t\u1eeb 20\u201330 ng\u00e0y; c\u00f2n \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 chi ph\u00ed cao h\u01a1n, t\u1eeb 5\u201310 USD\/kg (125.000\u2013250.000 VN\u0110\/kg) nh\u01b0ng giao h\u00e0ng nhanh h\u01a1n, ch\u1ec9 m\u1ea5t 5\u20137 ng\u00e0y. V\u00ed d\u1ee5, v\u1edbi 100kg h\u00e0ng, b\u1ea1n s\u1ebd t\u1ed1n kho\u1ea3ng 1.250.000\u20132.500.000 VN\u0110 n\u1ebfu \u0111i \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng bi\u1ec3n. \u0110\u00e1ng ch\u00fa \u00fd, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng Amazon SEND \u2013 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n n\u1ed9i \u0111\u1ecba v\u00e0 qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf t\u00edch h\u1ee3p s\u1eb5n c\u1ee7a Amazon \u2013 c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ti\u1ebft ki\u1ec7m \u0111\u1ebfn 30% chi ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n so v\u1edbi thu\u00ea ngo\u00e0i truy\u1ec1n th\u1ed1ng.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4568\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4568\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4568\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53-1.png\" alt=\"T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n tr\u00ean Amazon, \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 FBA, \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/53-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4568\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u1ea1o t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n tr\u00ean Amazon, \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 FBA<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-W8dHdjlWeoN2pnx08GBl3ll3g7d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>L\u01b0u kho &amp; ki\u1ec3m tra h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon FBA c\u00f3 h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng x\u1eed l\u00fd h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd ch\u1ec9 t\u1eeb 24\u201372 gi\u1edd k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb khi h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn kho. T\u1ea1i \u0111\u00e2y, robot t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ea3m nhi\u1ec7m vi\u1ec7c ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t t\u1ed3n kho v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c l\u00ean t\u1edbi 98%, gi\u00fap gi\u1ea3m thi\u1ec3u sai s\u00f3t v\u00e0 t\u0103ng hi\u1ec7u su\u1ea5t v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh. V\u1ec1 chi ph\u00ed l\u01b0u kho, h\u00e0ng ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n s\u1ebd ch\u1ecbu m\u1ee9c ph\u00ed 0,87 USD\/feet\u00b3 (t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng 21.750 VN\u0110) trong giai \u0111o\u1ea1n th\u00e1ng 1\u20139 v\u00e0 t\u0103ng l\u00ean 2,40 USD\/feet\u00b3 (60.000 VN\u0110) trong m\u00f9a cao \u0111i\u1ec3m t\u1eeb th\u00e1ng 10\u201312. \u0110\u1ed1i v\u1edbi h\u00e0ng c\u1ed3ng k\u1ec1nh, m\u1ee9c ph\u00ed dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 1,40\u20132,80 USD\/feet\u00b3 (kho\u1ea3ng 35.000\u201370.000 VN\u0110). N\u1ebfu s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m t\u1ed3n kho qu\u00e1 l\u00e2u (tr\u00ean 271 ng\u00e0y), Amazon s\u1ebd \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng ph\u00ed l\u01b0u kho d\u00e0i h\u1ea1n l\u00e0 6,90 USD\/feet\u00b3 (172.500 VN\u0110) ho\u1eb7c 0,15 USD cho m\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb h\u00e0ng (3.750 VN\u0110), t\u00f9y theo m\u1ee9c n\u00e0o cao h\u01a1n. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n n\u00ean qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u1ed3n kho ch\u1eb7t ch\u1ebd \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh ph\u00e1t sinh chi ph\u00ed kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n thi\u1ebft.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-EIwIdVO2Lofbouxa2icllNTngJE\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Kh\u00e1ch \u0111\u1eb7t h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon FBA mang l\u1ea1i tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m mua s\u1eafm v\u01b0\u1ee3t tr\u1ed9i cho kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nh\u1edd quy tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng si\u00eau t\u1ed1c, v\u1edbi th\u1eddi gian x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01a1n ch\u1ec9 trong 1\u20132 ph\u00fat. H\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng \u01b0u ti\u00ean ph\u1ee5c v\u1ee5 c\u00e1c th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean Prime \u2013 t\u1ec7p kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng trung th\u00e0nh h\u01a1n 200 tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi tr\u00ean to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u \u2013 gi\u00fap t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 doanh s\u1ed1 cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n. Nh\u1edd quy tr\u00ecnh v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh t\u1ed1i \u01b0u, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 h\u1ee7y \u0111\u01a1n tr\u00ean Amazon ch\u1ec9 kho\u1ea3ng 2,5%, th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n \u0111\u00e1ng k\u1ec3 so v\u1edbi nhi\u1ec1u n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng kh\u00e1c. Ngo\u00e0i ra, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m b\u1eb1ng h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o Sponsored Products. M\u1ee9c chi ph\u00ed trung b\u00ecnh kho\u1ea3ng 0,81 USD\/click (t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng 20.250 VN\u0110), v\u1edbi t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i cao, dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 12\u201315%, ch\u1ee9ng t\u1ecf \u0111\u00e2y l\u00e0 k\u00eanh qu\u1ea3ng b\u00e1 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 n\u1ebfu \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ed1i \u01b0u \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ZQ9DdWbIioNM9FxDyztlX4Rpgob\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i &amp; giao h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon FBA cung c\u1ea5p d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed9 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c l\u00ean t\u1edbi 99,9%, \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb \u0111\u00fang quy c\u00e1ch v\u00e0 \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi giao. M\u1ed7i \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd ch\u1ecbu ph\u00ed \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i t\u1eeb 1\u20132 USD (t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng 25.000\u201350.000 VN\u0110), t\u00f9y theo k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 y\u00eau c\u1ea7u \u0111\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t. Ph\u00ed giao h\u00e0ng FBA c\u0169ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e2n chia r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng: v\u1edbi c\u00e1c g\u00f3i h\u00e0ng d\u01b0\u1edbi 1 lb, ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n l\u00e0 3,39 USD (kho\u1ea3ng 84.750 VN\u0110), trong khi c\u00e1c ki\u1ec7n h\u00e0ng c\u1ed3ng k\u1ec1nh n\u1eb7ng tr\u00ean 150 lb c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1ed1n \u0111\u1ebfn 137,32 USD (t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng 3.433.000 VN\u0110). Amazon duy tr\u00ec t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 giao h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00fang h\u1ea1n cao, l\u00ean t\u1edbi 98,5%, g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n n\u00e2ng cao tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng v\u00e0 uy t\u00edn th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, t\u1ea1i m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 khu v\u1ef1c th\u1eed nghi\u1ec7m, Amazon \u0111ang tri\u1ec3n khai d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 giao h\u00e0ng b\u1eb1ng drone ch\u1ec9 trong 15 ph\u00fat, m\u1edf ra t\u01b0\u01a1ng lai m\u1edbi cho ng\u00e0nh logistics si\u00eau t\u1ed1c.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4569\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4569\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4569\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54.png\" alt=\"\u0110i\u1ec1u quan tr\u1ecdng l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i an to\u00e0n, \u0111\u00fang quy c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh h\u01b0 h\u1ecfng trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd, c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd c\u1ee7a Amazon di\u1ec5n ra su\u00f4n s\u1ebb. \" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/54-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4569\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">\u0110i\u1ec1u quan tr\u1ecdng l\u00e0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i an to\u00e0n, \u0111\u00fang quy c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh h\u01b0 h\u1ecfng trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd, c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd c\u1ee7a Amazon di\u1ec5n ra su\u00f4n s\u1ebb.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-B0p8d8aOwocxKxxCDeqlaIHNgkP\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>H\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng &amp; tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon FBA h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n v\u1edbi h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng ch\u0103m s\u00f3c kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng 24\/7, gi\u00fap gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft nhanh ch\u00f3ng t\u1edbi 95% y\u00eau c\u1ea7u trong v\u00f2ng 24 gi\u1edd. M\u1eb7c d\u00f9 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng trung b\u00ecnh tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng l\u00e0 kho\u1ea3ng 10,7%, c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh h\u00e0ng nh\u01b0 th\u1eddi trang c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cao h\u01a1n, dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 15\u201320% do \u0111\u1eb7c th\u00f9 s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. M\u1ed7i l\u1ea7n x\u1eed l\u00fd tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n s\u1ebd ch\u1ecbu m\u1ee9c ph\u00ed t\u1eeb 0,5\u20131 USD\/s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m (t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng 12.500\u201325.000 VN\u0110). Amazon c\u0169ng tri\u1ec3n khai d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 ho\u00e0n ti\u1ec1n t\u1ef1 \u0111\u1ed9ng \u2013 quy tr\u00ecnh minh b\u1ea1ch, nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3, v\u1edbi h\u01a1n 90% kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng c\u1ea3m th\u1ea5y h\u00e0i l\u00f2ng. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap t\u0103ng tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n n\u00e2ng cao uy t\u00edn c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n trong h\u1ec7 sinh th\u00e1i Amazon.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-NrpJd3948oBwlixQgAalVYkDgXe\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Nh\u1eadn ti\u1ec1n v\u1ec1 t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n<\/strong><\/h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Khi b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng qua Amazon FBA, ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n s\u1ebd nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ti\u1ec1n sau kho\u1ea3ng 14\u201321 ng\u00e0y k\u1ec3 t\u1eeb khi \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ho\u00e0n t\u1ea5t, \u0111\u00e3 tr\u1eeb c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed li\u00ean quan. Trong \u0111\u00f3, ph\u00ed FBA dao \u0111\u1ed9ng t\u1eeb 2,84\u20135,37 USD\/\u0111\u01a1n (t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng 71.000\u2013134.250 VN\u0110), t\u00f9y thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0 tr\u1ecdng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m. B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3, Amazon c\u0169ng thu ph\u00ed gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u (referral fee) t\u1eeb 8\u201315% tr\u00ean gi\u00e1 b\u00e1n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m, c\u00f9ng v\u1edbi ph\u00ed chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i ngo\u1ea1i t\u1ec7 t\u1eeb 1\u20132% (kho\u1ea3ng 5.000\u201310.000 VN\u0110 cho m\u1ed7i USD). V\u00ed d\u1ee5, n\u1ebfu m\u1ed9t s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c b\u00e1n v\u1edbi gi\u00e1 500.000 VN\u0110 (t\u01b0\u01a1ng \u0111\u01b0\u01a1ng 20 USD), ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n sau khi tr\u1eeb c\u00e1c lo\u1ea1i ph\u00ed s\u1ebd thu v\u1ec1 kho\u1ea3ng 300.000\u2013375.000 VN\u0110 (12\u201315 USD). Nh\u1edd h\u1ec7 th\u1ed1ng thanh to\u00e1n chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, Amazon \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 thanh to\u00e1n \u0111\u00fang h\u1ea1n l\u00ean t\u1edbi 99%, t\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 an t\u00e2m cho ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n khi kinh doanh tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng n\u00e0y.<\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-TlAOdwwK7oqaRExTeQtl1z5wgYb\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1ch th\u1ee9c v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n h\u00e0ng c\u1ee7a Amazon<\/h2>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-HByHdFwKooRxzixdodhl1Y5vghd\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Amazon FBA (Fulfillment by Amazon)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AZtYd5axnocrdvxzgI6lP88Ogdc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">FBA (Fulfillment by Amazon) l\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 m\u00e0 Amazon ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m l\u01b0u tr\u1eef s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n t\u1ea1i c\u00e1c trung t\u00e2m c\u1ee7a h\u1ecd, sau \u0111\u00f3 \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i, v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 x\u1eed l\u00fd d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng khi c\u00f3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ch\u1ec9 c\u1ea7n g\u1eedi h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn kho Amazon, m\u1ecdi vi\u1ec7c c\u00f2n l\u1ea1i do Amazon lo.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QLj3dm0zPox8DOxRU0QlIwYPg3w\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u01afu \u0111i\u1ec3m: Giao h\u00e0ng c\u1ef1c nhanh, d\u1ec5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1eafn nh\u00e3n Prime, t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i. Nh\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111i\u1ec3m: Ph\u00ed d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1 cao, \u00edt ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t h\u00e0ng t\u1ed3n kho v\u00e0 chi ti\u1ebft quy tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-WuindMDMmoyVC1xV4wDls7S2gth\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Amazon FBM (Fulfillment by Merchant)<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UlkDdr7c0oLASDxtwuBlRnnzgWh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">FBM (Fulfillment by Merchant), c\u00f2n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c g\u1ecdi l\u00e0 Merchant Fulfilled Network (MFN), l\u00e0 h\u00ecnh th\u1ee9c ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n t\u1ef1 qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 quy tr\u00ecnh ho\u00e0n thi\u1ec7n \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, t\u1eeb l\u01b0u tr\u1eef, \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i cho \u0111\u1ebfn v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp \u0111\u1ebfn tay kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng sau khi nh\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Amazon. Ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n ho\u00e0n to\u00e0n ch\u1ecbu tr\u00e1ch nhi\u1ec7m v\u1ec1 logistics v\u00e0 d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-Ak5YdW5Dioa4Zpx8LRflTWgsgfd\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Amazon Prime<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-U3fmd6EFZoybVxx22s8lYfGwgJh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon Prime l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd tr\u1ea3 ph\u00ed c\u1ee7a Amazon, cung c\u1ea5p cho c\u00e1c th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean nhi\u1ec1u l\u1ee3i \u00edch \u0111\u1eb7c quy\u1ec1n, trong \u0111\u00f3 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 giao h\u00e0ng nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 mi\u1ec5n ph\u00ed (th\u01b0\u1eddng trong 1-2 ng\u00e0y) cho h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m \u0111\u1ee7 \u0111i\u1ec1u ki\u1ec7n (ch\u1ee7 y\u1ebfu l\u00e0 h\u00e0ng FBA). \u0110\u00e2y kh\u00f4ng ph\u1ea3i l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t ph\u01b0\u01a1ng th\u1ee9c v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n m\u00e0 l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u01b0u \u0111\u00e3i t\u1ed1c \u0111\u1ed9 giao h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4572\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4572\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4572\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3.png\" alt=\" Amazon Prime l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi tham gia ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u1edbi v\u00f4 v\u00e0n l\u1ee3i \u00edch t\u1eeb Amazon.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/LEMON-DIGITAL-3-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4572\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">v Amazon Prime l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd gi\u00fap ng\u01b0\u1eddi tham gia ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u1edbi v\u00f4 v\u00e0n l\u1ee3i \u00edch t\u1eeb Amazon.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-ZmeidBfyOot87Axge7vlqbAog0f\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Amazon Delivery Services<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XHaEdhHyoogBnQxAOdDlYIqXgzd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon Delivery Services l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t kh\u00e1i ni\u1ec7m r\u1ed9ng, bao g\u1ed3m to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 m\u1ea1ng l\u01b0\u1edbi logistics v\u00e0 c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n m\u00e0 Amazon s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u01b0a h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a t\u1eeb kho \u0111\u1ebfn tay kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. N\u00f3 bao g\u1ed3m \u0111\u1ed9i ng\u0169 giao h\u00e0ng ri\u00eang c\u1ee7a Amazon (Amazon Logistics), c\u00e1c \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n b\u00ean ngo\u00e0i (nh\u01b0 UPS, FedEx), v\u00e0 c\u00e1c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 giao h\u00e0ng chuy\u00ean bi\u1ec7t kh\u00e1c m\u00e0 Amazon \u0111i\u1ec1u h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ec3 \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh ph\u00e2n ph\u1ed1i h\u00e0ng h\u00f3a.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VHYbdNc5koU4R3xJ1thlnpNagYb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-OCebdQLqPo9Ee6x0tzFlCiKIgah\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Th\u1eddi gian v\u00e0 chi ph\u00ed v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Jny2dw1dFoG55Xx8q9Slc7rZgIg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Th\u1eddi gian v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 kh\u00e1c nhau t\u00f9y thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0o nhi\u1ec1u y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 nh\u01b0:<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XL73dRL6JoGE4HxjsMnlVOA1gRf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>1. Lo\u1ea1i h\u00ecnh v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n:<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AfM6dZk0CoDshfxaAhFldKlUgth\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>V\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n h\u00e0ng kh\u00f4ng (Air freight):<\/strong> Th\u01b0\u1eddng nhanh h\u01a1n, l\u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng cho c\u00e1c l\u00f4 h\u00e0ng nh\u1ecf h\u01a1n ho\u1eb7c c\u1ea7n g\u1ea5p.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zv26dg38zoq6l0xIHs4l8brigKR\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1eeb Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u0111\u1ebfn M\u1ef9: Kho\u1ea3ng 5-10 ng\u00e0y (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: UPS Expedited 5-7 ng\u00e0y, Dragon Pacific Express 5-10 ng\u00e0y).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RgfFdmaStoJnH5xmVtElqDnugUy\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u00e2u \u00c1 &#8211; M\u1ef9 ho\u1eb7c Ch\u00e2u \u00c1 &#8211; Ch\u00e2u \u00c2u: Kho\u1ea3ng 5-10 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FsO3dZwewoRinkxUEeKlIh8CgMf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong> V\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng bi\u1ec3n (Ocean freight):<\/strong> Ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p cho c\u00e1c l\u00f4 h\u00e0ng l\u1edbn h\u01a1n, chi ph\u00ed th\u1ea5p h\u01a1n nh\u01b0ng th\u1eddi gian d\u00e0i h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet2\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CtwVdbNX0oyJHRxTQ0nlLCtUgJc\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>T\u1eeb Vi\u1ec7t Nam \u0111\u1ebfn M\u1ef9: Kho\u1ea3ng 35-48 ng\u00e0y (LCL ho\u1eb7c FCL).<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTwDd8cUuoaxj9xSInLl8GiSgKf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u00e2u \u00c1 &#8211; M\u1ef9: Kho\u1ea3ng 20-40 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YChid13ysocCcUxVqtIlf84mg9f\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>Ch\u00e2u \u00c1 &#8211; Ch\u00e2u \u00c2u: Kho\u1ea3ng 25-45 ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VX89dMWIMogk3nxFUnUlRNBagxb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>2. \u0110\u1ecba \u0111i\u1ec3m g\u1eedi v\u00e0 nh\u1eadn h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> Kho\u1ea3ng c\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ecba l\u00fd c\u00e0ng xa th\u00ec th\u1eddi gian v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n c\u00e0ng l\u00e2u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-DXkSdt4xdoHouTxKuH8lgWjNgad\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>3. Th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd c\u1ee7a Amazon FBA:<\/strong> Sau khi h\u00e0ng \u0111\u1ebfn kho Amazon, th\u1eddi gian x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u1ec3 h\u00e0ng s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng b\u00e1n th\u01b0\u1eddng m\u1ea5t t\u1eeb 2-6 ng\u00e0y. Tuy nhi\u00ean, th\u1eddi gian n\u00e0y c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 k\u00e9o d\u00e0i h\u01a1n trong m\u00f9a cao \u0111i\u1ec3m (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: Prime Day, Black Friday, m\u00f9a l\u1ec5), do s\u1ef1 c\u1ed1 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n, v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 nh\u00e2n s\u1ef1 ho\u1eb7c l\u1ed7i trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh x\u1eed l\u00fd.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-X9T4d72kno374exNtHellCPMgJd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div>\n<div><strong>4. D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 giao h\u00e0ng cu\u1ed1i c\u00f9ng (\u0111\u1ebfn tay kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng):<\/strong><\/div>\n<div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KNCldkvSvoqM6SxMUZdlkaLigef\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Giao h\u00e0ng ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n FBA:<\/strong> Kho\u1ea3ng 4-5 ng\u00e0y l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-YHqidQjNPoeJDzxirXTlIDdhgvd\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Amazon Prime:<\/strong> Th\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0 1-2 ng\u00e0y, th\u1eadm ch\u00ed giao h\u00e0ng trong ng\u00e0y \u1edf m\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 th\u00e0nh ph\u1ed1 cho th\u00e0nh vi\u00ean Prime.<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M90PdmgdGolzK3xQwr1lk1Odgnh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-Z1xGdQdjSocT8uxvhJ3lI8jogoe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0u \u00fd khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Amazon<\/h2>\n<figure id=\"attachment_4573\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-4573\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-4573\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60.png\" alt=\"M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0u \u00fd khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Amazon\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/60-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-4573\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">M\u1ed9t s\u1ed1 l\u01b0u \u00fd khi s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 Amazon<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WWS7dZrMpoiQFNxJIc1l8w9wgxv\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110\u0103ng k\u00fd &amp; ph\u00e1p l\u00fd:<\/strong> C\u1ea7n cung c\u1ea5p CCCD\/h\u1ed9 chi\u1ebfu, th\u1ebb t\u00edn d\u1ee5ng qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf v\u00e0 h\u00f3a \u0111\u01a1n ti\u1ec7n \u00edch. Nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n c\u1ea7n n\u1ed9p bi\u1ec3u m\u1eabu thu\u1ebf ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p (W-8BEN ho\u1eb7c W-9) \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb gi\u1eef ti\u1ec1n. T\u00ean t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n nh\u1eadn thanh to\u00e1n ph\u1ea3i kh\u1edbp v\u1edbi th\u00f4ng tin \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd tr\u00ean Amazon.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UdCzd7AVhorUTBxZTvxliLzOgFh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>S\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m:<\/strong> Kh\u00f4ng b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ea5m ho\u1eb7c s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ch\u1ee9a pin, ch\u1ea5t l\u1ecfng n\u1ebfu ch\u01b0a \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00e9p. N\u00ean \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 chu\u1ea9n h\u00f3a m\u00e3 v\u1ea1ch (UPC\/EAN) \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh b\u1ecb kh\u00f3a s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-H9WBdIUGOor9brxwrFolVHLRgfV\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>G\u1eedi h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> \u0110\u00f3ng g\u00f3i \u0111\u00fang chu\u1ea9n Amazon (ch\u1ed1ng s\u1ed1c, d\u00e1n nh\u00e3n FNSKU). N\u00ean ch\u1ecdn \u0111\u01a1n v\u1ecb v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u tr\u1ecdng l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, k\u00edch th\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3m chi ph\u00ed logistics.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xdo1dG9ICooIoKxgSgzlx1JDggv\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>T\u1ed3n kho &amp; chi ph\u00ed:<\/strong> Qu\u1ea3n l\u00fd t\u1ed3n kho ch\u1eb7t ch\u1ebd \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh b\u1ecb t\u00ednh ph\u00ed l\u01b0u kho d\u00e0i h\u1ea1n. S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng c\u00f4ng c\u1ee5 nh\u01b0 FBA Fee Calculator \u0111\u1ec3 t\u00ednh to\u00e1n l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IJvpdrifToxqQkxb6R3lFqZZgfh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o:<\/strong> S\u1eed d\u1ee5ng Sponsored Products \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb v\u00e0 doanh s\u1ed1, nh\u1ea5t l\u00e0 khi ra m\u1eaft s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u1edbi. Lu\u00f4n theo d\u00f5i chi ph\u00ed v\u00e0 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u ng\u00e2n s\u00e1ch.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Zs7ydca25odrhoxA2iLl1ZJ3gEc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>\u0110\u01a1n h\u00e0ng &amp; tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng:<\/strong> Amazon s\u1ebd \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i, giao h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 h\u1ed7 tr\u1ee3 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. Tuy nhi\u00ean, t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 tr\u1ea3 h\u00e0ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 cao v\u1edbi c\u00e1c ng\u00e0nh nh\u01b0 th\u1eddi trang, n\u00ean c\u1ea7n m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IdaCdyTrho9zO1xtDCFlDnQrgWc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Thanh to\u00e1n:<\/strong> Ti\u1ec1n s\u1ebd \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c chuy\u1ec3n sau 14\u201321 ng\u00e0y. N\u00ean d\u00f9ng Payoneer ho\u1eb7c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n USD \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1ea3m ph\u00ed r\u00fat ti\u1ec1n v\u00e0 theo d\u00f5i t\u1ef7 gi\u00e1 th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u l\u1ee3i nhu\u1eadn.<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KnV1dx1gCo7GsCx700SlKprWgOc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch &amp; vi ph\u1ea1m:<\/strong> Amazon ki\u1ec3m so\u00e1t nghi\u00eam ng\u1eb7t c\u00e1c h\u00e0nh vi gian l\u1eadn nh\u01b0 \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 \u1ea3o, m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 sai, nh\u00e3n kh\u00f4ng h\u1ee3p l\u1ec7. Lu\u00f4n theo d\u00f5i c\u1ea3nh b\u00e1o v\u00e0 ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u00e1nh kh\u00f3a t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GkBtdoFs1ozo6FxmhMGlEIAfgWb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PLvldnc8DoPosxxOpImlRUQJgIf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>C\u00d4NG TY C\u1ed4 PH\u1ea6N LEMON DIGITAL<\/strong><\/div>\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li><strong>\u0110\u1ecba ch\u1ec9: <\/strong>202 Phan V\u0103n H\u00e2n, Ph\u01b0\u1eddng Gia \u0110\u1ecbnh, H\u1ed3 Ch\u00ed Minh, Vi\u1ec7t Nam<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZDtldgDUFoQnjdx2wO1lbXoVgIM\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>\u0110i\u1ec7n tho\u1ea1i: <\/strong>0938785735<\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-L98kdMPZFo9VvXxOLM5l4nRmgwb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Email: <\/strong><a href=\"mailto:hi@lemondigital.vn\">hi@lemondigital.vn<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WN4YdgN1KoXBdgxeeHFllMnbgFb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div><strong>Website: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\">https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UiNXdUOPhoMX9LxSDkdl8sn3gSP\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong>Facebook: <\/strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/lemondigital.vn\">Lemon Digital<\/a><\/div>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>\u00a0 D\u1ecbch v\u1ee5 v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh Amazon l\u00e0 g\u00f3i gi\u1ea3i ph\u00e1p to\u00e0n di\u1ec7n gi\u00fap nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n v\u00e0 t\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a to\u00e0n b\u1ed9 quy tr\u00ecnh kinh doanh tr\u00ean s\u00e0n Amazon \u2013 t\u1eeb kh\u00e2u \u0111\u0103ng k\u00fd t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n, v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n h\u00e0ng, l\u01b0u kho, x\u1eed l\u00fd \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng, v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n nhanh ch\u00f3ng \u0111\u1ebfn tay kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":5,"featured_media":4778,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","m